ी प्रभावित क्षेत्रको लागि विशेष मौसम बुलेटिन -२१  ( Bhotekoshi Flood Affected Area’s Special Weather Bulletin - 21) (जारी मिति ː २०८३/०६/०३  साँझ ०५:३० बजे)","url":"https://dhm.gov.np/mfd/#/weather/pages/special-weather/12281","issued_at":"2026-09-19T17:44:55+05:45","page_id":12281},"forecast":{"src":"dhm_country","issued_at":"2026-09-25T08:00:00+05:45","label":{"ne":"आज","en":"Today"},"analysis":{"ne":"हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको साथै पश्चिमी वायुको पनि आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। साथै बलियो न्यून चापीय प्रणाली (Depression) भारतको उत्तर महाराष्ट्र तथा छत्तिसगढ प्रदेश आसपासको रहेको छ।  यो प्रणाली उत्तर-उत्तरपश्चिमतर्फ सर्दै आगामी २४ घण्टामा क्रमशः कमजोर हुने न्यून चापीय प्रणालीको रुपमा रहने सम्भावना रहेको छ।\n","en":"Currently, the entire country is under the influence of monsoon winds, along with a partial influence of westerly winds. In addition, a strong low-pressure system (Depression) is located around northern Maharashtra and Chhattisgarh in India. The system is expected to move north-northwestward and gradually weaken over the next 24 hours, remaining as a low-pressure system."},"text":{"ne":" देशभर अधिकांश बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी  र कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा  तथा सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका पहाडी र तराई भू-भाग, कर्णाली प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका अधिकांश स्थानमा  साथै मधेश प्रदेशका केही स्थानमा तथा सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको पहाडी र तराई भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र कर्णाली प्रदेशको थोरै स्थानमा भारी देखि धेरै भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | लुम्बिनी र गण्डकी प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा अति भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । मधेश प्रदेशको एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा हावाहुरीको समेत सम्भावना छ ।","en":"  Mostly cloudy conditions will prevail across the country. Moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Karnali Provinces, and at many places in the Himalayan region of Sudurpashchim Province. Moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is likely at most places in the hilly and Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces, the hilly region of Karnali Province, at some places in Madhesh Province, and at many places in the hilly and Terai regions of Sudurpashchim Province. Heavy to very heavy rainfall is likely at a few places in Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Karnali Provinces. Extremely heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Lumbini and Gandaki Provinces. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in Madhesh Province. Windstorms are also likely at some places in Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, and Lumbini Provinces.      "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T08:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-09-25T08:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-09-24T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:15+05:45","status":"ok"}}}